@NotificationService_HostAddress = http://localhost:5274

### Order confirmation
POST {{NotificationService_HostAddress}}/api/emails/order-confirmations
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "maya.chen@example.com",
  "customerName": "Maya Chen",
  "orderNumber": "CO-104582",
  "items": [
    { "sku": "TNT-RDG-2P", "name": "Ridgeline 2P Backpacking Tent", "quantity": 1, "unitPrice": 349.00 },
    { "sku": "SCK-MRN-3PK", "name": "Trailhead Merino Hiking Socks (3-pack)", "quantity": 2, "unitPrice": 36.00 }
  ],
  "shippingCost": 0,
  "tax": 0,
  "shipTo": { "line1": "2217 SE Hawthorne Blvd", "city": "Portland", "region": "OR", "postalCode": "97214" }
}

### Password reset
POST {{NotificationService_HostAddress}}/api/emails/password-resets
Content-Type: application/json

{ "email": "daniel.okafor@example.net", "customerName": "Daniel Okafor", "expiresInMinutes": 30 }

### Shipping notification
POST {{NotificationService_HostAddress}}/api/emails/shipping-notifications
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "maya.chen@example.com",
  "customerName": "Maya Chen",
  "orderNumber": "CO-104582",
  "carrier": "ups",
  "trackingNumber": "1Z999AA10123456784",
  "estimatedDelivery": "2026-11-27",
  "itemCount": 4
}

### 400 validation problem details
POST {{NotificationService_HostAddress}}/api/emails/password-resets
Content-Type: application/json

{ "email": "not-an-email", "customerName": "", "expiresInMinutes": 600 }

### Preview a template (HTML)
GET {{NotificationService_HostAddress}}/api/emails/templates/shipping-notification/preview

### 404 problem details
GET {{NotificationService_HostAddress}}/api/emails/templates/newsletter/preview

### Send the sample batch (Development only)
POST {{NotificationService_HostAddress}}/dev/sample-emails
